{
  "string": {
    "ConfirmationText": "感谢您对 {name} 的兴趣。要完成注册过程，请将以下链接复制到您的浏览器的 URL 栏中 {link}。此致，{name} 团队。",
    "ConfirmationHTML": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F2F2F7;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#F2F2F7;padding:40px 16px\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"520\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:520px;width:100%\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#18181B;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;padding:24px 40px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;letter-spacing:-0.3px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{app}</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;padding:36px 40px;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">您好，</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">感谢您对 {name} 的兴趣。要完成注册过程，请点击 <a href=\"{link}\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#18181B;text-decoration:underline\">此链接</a> 或将以下链接复制到您的浏览器的 URL 栏中。</p><p style=\"margin:16px 0 0 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#A1A1AA;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\"><a href=\"{link}\" style=\"color:#71717A;word-break:break-all;text-decoration:underline;font-size:12px\">{link}</a></p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin-top:28px\"><tr><td style=\"border-top:1px solid #F4F4F5;padding-top:24px\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.5;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">此致，<br>{name} 团队。</p></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 0\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#9CA3AF;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">&copy; {app} &mdash; All rights reserved</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
    "ConfirmationSubject": "确认您的电子邮件地址以注册 {name}",
    "RecoveryText": "我们收到了重置您账户密码的请求。要重置您的密码，请将以下链接粘贴到您的浏览器地址栏中：{link}。如果您没有请求密码重置，请忽略此邮件。",
    "RecoveryHTML": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F2F2F7;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#F2F2F7;padding:40px 16px\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"520\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:520px;width:100%\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#18181B;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;padding:24px 40px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;letter-spacing:-0.3px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{app}</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;padding:36px 40px;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 28px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">我们收到了重置您账户密码的请求。要重置您的密码，请点击以下链接：</p><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#18181B;border-radius:8px\"><a href=\"{link}\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:13px 26px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:-0.1px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">重置密码 &rarr;</a></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:28px 0 0 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#A1A1AA;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">如果上面的重置密码链接不起作用，请将以下链接粘贴到您的浏览器地址栏中：<br><a href=\"{link}\" style=\"color:#71717A;word-break:break-all;text-decoration:underline;font-size:12px\">{link}</a></p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin-top:28px\"><tr><td style=\"border-top:1px solid #F4F4F5;padding-top:24px\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.5;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">如果您没有请求密码重置，请忽略此邮件。</p></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 0\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#9CA3AF;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">&copy; {app} &mdash; All rights reserved</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
    "RecoverySubject": "密码恢复",
    "InviteText": "您被邀请加入 {ws}。要加入，请将以下链接粘贴到您的浏览器地址栏中：{link}。链接有效期为 {expHours} 小时。",
    "InviteHTML": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F2F2F7;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#F2F2F7;padding:40px 16px\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"520\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:520px;width:100%\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#18181B;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;padding:24px 40px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;letter-spacing:-0.3px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{app}</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;padding:36px 40px;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 28px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">您被邀请加入 <b>{ws}</b>。要加入，请点击以下链接：</p><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#18181B;border-radius:8px\"><a href=\"{link}\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:13px 26px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:-0.1px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">加入 &rarr;</a></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:28px 0 0 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#A1A1AA;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">如果上面的邀请链接不起作用，请将以下链接粘贴到您的浏览器地址栏中：<br><a href=\"{link}\" style=\"color:#71717A;word-break:break-all;text-decoration:underline;font-size:12px\">{link}</a></p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin-top:28px\"><tr><td style=\"border-top:1px solid #F4F4F5;padding-top:24px\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.5;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">链接有效期为 {expHours} 小时。</p></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 0\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#9CA3AF;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">&copy; {app} &mdash; All rights reserved</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
    "InviteSubject": "邀请加入 {ws}",
    "OtpText": "确认您的电子邮件地址以访问 {app}！\n\n您的确认码如下 - 请在您开始登录 {app} 的窗口中输入。\n\n{code}\n\n如果您没有请求此邮件，不用担心 — 您可以放心地忽略它。",
    "OtpHTML": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F2F2F7;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#F2F2F7;padding:40px 16px\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"520\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:520px;width:100%\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#18181B;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;padding:24px 40px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;letter-spacing:-0.3px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{app}</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;padding:36px 40px;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px\"><h1 style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#18181B;letter-spacing:-0.4px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.3\">确认您的电子邮件地址以访问 {app}！</h1><p style=\"margin:0 0 28px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">您的确认码如下 - 请在您开始登录 {app} 的窗口中输入。</p><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"background-color:#FAFAFA;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-radius:8px;padding:20px 24px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:36px;font-weight:700;color:#18181B;letter-spacing:6px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{code}</span></td></tr></table><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin-top:28px\"><tr><td style=\"border-top:1px solid #F4F4F5;padding-top:24px\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.5;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">如果您没有请求此邮件，不用担心 — 您可以放心地忽略它。</p></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 0\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#9CA3AF;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">&copy; {app} &mdash; All rights reserved</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
    "SignUpOtpText": "确认您的电子邮件地址以访问 {app}！\n\n您的确认码如下 - 请在您开始注册 {app} 的窗口中输入。\n\n{code}\n\n验证码仅在几分钟内有效。如果已过期或您关闭了窗口，请打开此链接完成注册：\n{link}\n\n如果您没有请求此邮件，不用担心 — 您可以放心地忽略它。",
    "SignUpOtpHTML": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F2F2F7;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#F2F2F7;padding:40px 16px\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"520\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:520px;width:100%\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#18181B;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;padding:24px 40px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;letter-spacing:-0.3px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{app}</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;padding:36px 40px;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px\"><h1 style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#18181B;letter-spacing:-0.4px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.3\">确认您的电子邮件地址以访问 {app}！</h1><p style=\"margin:0 0 28px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">您的确认码如下 - 请在您开始注册 {app} 的窗口中输入。</p><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"background-color:#FAFAFA;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-radius:8px;padding:20px 24px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:36px;font-weight:700;color:#18181B;letter-spacing:6px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{code}</span></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:28px 0 0 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#A1A1AA;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">验证码仅在几分钟内有效。如果已过期或您关闭了窗口，<a href=\"{link}\" style=\"color:#71717A;text-decoration:underline\">请通过此链接完成注册</a>。<br><a href=\"{link}\" style=\"color:#71717A;word-break:break-all;text-decoration:underline;font-size:12px\">{link}</a></p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin-top:28px\"><tr><td style=\"border-top:1px solid #F4F4F5;padding-top:24px\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.5;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">如果您没有请求此邮件，不用担心 — 您可以放心地忽略它。</p></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 0\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#9CA3AF;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">&copy; {app} &mdash; All rights reserved</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
    "OtpSubject": "{app} 确认码：{code}",
    "ResendInviteText": "您已被重新邀请加入 {ws}。请使用以下链接加入：{link}。重新邀请链接的有效期为 {expHours} 小时。",
    "ResendInviteHTML": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F2F2F7;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#F2F2F7;padding:40px 16px\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"520\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:520px;width:100%\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#18181B;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;padding:24px 40px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;letter-spacing:-0.3px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{app}</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;padding:36px 40px;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 28px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">您已被重新邀请加入 <b>{ws}</b>。要加入，请点击以下链接：</p><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#18181B;border-radius:8px\"><a href=\"{link}\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:13px 26px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:-0.1px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">加入 &rarr;</a></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:28px 0 0 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#A1A1AA;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">如果上方的邀请链接无效，请将以下链接粘贴到您的浏览器地址栏中：<br><a href=\"{link}\" style=\"color:#71717A;word-break:break-all;text-decoration:underline;font-size:12px\">{link}</a></p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin-top:28px\"><tr><td style=\"border-top:1px solid #F4F4F5;padding-top:24px\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.5;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">重新邀请链接的有效期为 {expHours} 小时。</p></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 0\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#9CA3AF;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">&copy; {app} &mdash; All rights reserved</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
    "ResendInviteSubject": "重新邀请加入 {ws}",
    "AdminOtpSubject": "Confirmation code for an administrator action",
    "AdminOtpText": "You are about to perform a sensitive administrator action in {app} (deleting/archiving a workspace, changing members or a subscription, renaming a URL, or deleting an account).\n\nYour confirmation code is:\n\n{code}\n\nEnter it in the admin panel to confirm. If you did not initiate this action, do NOT share this code and review your account security.",
    "AdminOtpHTML": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F2F2F7;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#F2F2F7;padding:40px 16px\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"520\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:520px;width:100%\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#18181B;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;padding:24px 40px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;letter-spacing:-0.3px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{app}</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;padding:36px 40px;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">You are about to perform a sensitive administrator action in <b>{app}</b> (deleting/archiving a workspace, changing members or a subscription, renaming a URL, or deleting an account).</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Your confirmation code is:</p><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"background-color:#FAFAFA;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-radius:8px;padding:20px 24px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:36px;font-weight:700;color:#18181B;letter-spacing:6px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{code}</span></td></tr></table><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin-top:28px\"><tr><td style=\"border-top:1px solid #F4F4F5;padding-top:24px\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.5;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Enter it in the admin panel to confirm. If you did not initiate this action, do NOT share this code and review your account security.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 0\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#9CA3AF;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">&copy; {app} &mdash; All rights reserved</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
    "OperationOtpSubject": "{app} 操作确认码",
    "OperationOtpText": "您请求在 {app} 中退出工作区、删除工作区或删除账户。\n\n您的确认码是：\n\n{code}\n\n请在您发起此操作的窗口中输入。如果这不是您本人的请求，请勿与任何人分享此确认码，并检查您的账户安全。",
    "OperationOtpHTML": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F2F2F7;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#F2F2F7;padding:40px 16px\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"520\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:520px;width:100%\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#18181B;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;padding:24px 40px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;letter-spacing:-0.3px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{app}</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;padding:36px 40px;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">您请求在 <b>{app}</b> 中退出工作区、删除工作区或删除账户。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">您的确认码是：</p><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"background-color:#FAFAFA;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-radius:8px;padding:20px 24px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:36px;font-weight:700;color:#18181B;letter-spacing:6px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{code}</span></td></tr></table><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin-top:28px\"><tr><td style=\"border-top:1px solid #F4F4F5;padding-top:24px\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.5;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">请在您发起此操作的窗口中输入。如果这不是您本人的请求，请勿与任何人分享此确认码，并检查您的账户安全。</p></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 0\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#9CA3AF;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">&copy; {app} &mdash; All rights reserved</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
    "WorkspaceDeletionScheduledSubject": "工作区 {ws} 已计划删除",
    "WorkspaceDeletionScheduledText": "工作区 {ws}（{url}）将于 {date} 被删除。{readonlyDays, plural, =0 {} other {它会以只读方式再开放 # 天，便于导出数据。}}随后归档；到期当天工作区及其备份将被永久删除。在此之前，任何所有者都可以取消删除：{link}",
    "WorkspaceDeletionScheduledHTML": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F2F2F7;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#F2F2F7;padding:40px 16px\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"520\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:520px;width:100%\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#18181B;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;padding:24px 40px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;letter-spacing:-0.3px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{app}</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;padding:36px 40px;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">工作区 <b>{ws}</b>（{url}）将于 <b>{date}</b> 被删除。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{readonlyDays, plural, =0 {} other {它会以只读方式再开放 # 天，便于导出数据。}}随后归档；到期当天工作区及其备份将被永久删除。</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">在此之前，任何所有者都可以取消删除：<a href=\"{link}\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#18181B;word-break:break-all;text-decoration:underline\">{link}</a></p></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 0\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#9CA3AF;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">&copy; {app} &mdash; All rights reserved</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
    "WorkspaceDeletedSubject": "工作区 {ws} 正在被删除",
    "WorkspaceDeletedText": "工作区 {ws}（{url}）正在被立即删除，没有通常的缓冲期。数据及其备份无法恢复。",
    "WorkspaceDeletedHTML": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F2F2F7;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#F2F2F7;padding:40px 16px\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"520\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:520px;width:100%\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#18181B;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;padding:24px 40px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;letter-spacing:-0.3px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{app}</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;padding:36px 40px;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">工作区 <b>{ws}</b>（{url}）正在被立即删除，没有通常的缓冲期。</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">数据及其备份无法恢复。</p></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 0\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#9CA3AF;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">&copy; {app} &mdash; All rights reserved</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
    "AccountDeletionScheduledSubject": "您的账户已计划删除",
    "AccountDeletionScheduledText": "您的账户将于 {date} 被删除。在该日期之前登录即可取消删除：{link}",
    "AccountDeletionScheduledHTML": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F2F2F7;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#F2F2F7;padding:40px 16px\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"520\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:520px;width:100%\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#18181B;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;padding:24px 40px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;letter-spacing:-0.3px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{app}</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;padding:36px 40px;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">您的账户将于 <b>{date}</b> 被删除。</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">在该日期之前登录即可取消删除：<a href=\"{link}\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#18181B;word-break:break-all;text-decoration:underline\">{link}</a></p></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 0\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#9CA3AF;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">&copy; {app} &mdash; All rights reserved</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
    "AccountDeletedSubject": "您的账户已被删除",
    "AccountDeletedText": "您的账户已被删除。所有可识别您身份的信息均已清除，该邮箱可用于重新注册。",
    "AccountDeletedHTML": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F2F2F7;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#F2F2F7;padding:40px 16px\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"520\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:520px;width:100%\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#18181B;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;padding:24px 40px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;letter-spacing:-0.3px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{app}</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;padding:36px 40px;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">您的账户已被删除。</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">所有可识别您身份的信息均已清除，该邮箱可用于重新注册。</p></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 0\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#9CA3AF;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">&copy; {app} &mdash; All rights reserved</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
    "AccountDeletionCancelledSubject": "您的 {app} 账户已重新激活",
    "AccountDeletionCancelledText": "您 {app} 账户的删除已取消 - 账户已重新激活。\n\n感谢您继续留在我们这里！\n\n您提交删除的工作区仍按计划保留，每个都需要单独恢复：{link}",
    "AccountDeletionCancelledHTML": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F2F2F7;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#F2F2F7;padding:40px 16px\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"520\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:520px;width:100%\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#18181B;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;padding:24px 40px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;letter-spacing:-0.3px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{app}</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;padding:36px 40px;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">您 <b>{app}</b> 账户的删除已取消 - 账户已重新激活。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">感谢您继续留在我们这里！</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">您提交删除的工作区仍按计划保留，每个都需要单独恢复：<a href=\"{link}\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#18181B;word-break:break-all;text-decoration:underline\">{link}</a></p></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 0\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#9CA3AF;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">&copy; {app} &mdash; All rights reserved</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
    "WorkspaceDeletionCancelledSubject": "工作区 {ws} 将不会被删除",
    "WorkspaceDeletionCancelledText": "工作区 {ws}（{url}）的删除已被取消。{state, select, archived {它已被归档 - 任何所有者都可以恢复它：{link}} restoring {它正在从归档中恢复，很快将重新可用：{link}} other {它已完全恢复可用：{link}}}\n\n感谢您继续留在我们这里！",
