mFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">感谢您继续留在我们这里！</p></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 0\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#9CA3AF;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">&copy; {app} &mdash; All rights reserved</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>"
  }
